    "detailed_description": "Lightphobe is a game that's all about the satisfying feeling of knifing players in FPS games, and also the flip side of catching knifers in the act!<br><br>Invincible in the dark, Lightphobes must be exposed by a special light source before they can be killed. This additional game mechanic gives Lightphobes more agency to move around, but closing the gap and eliminating soldiers will still require cunning stealth skills and quick thinking.<br><br>No matter what side you pick, teamwork will be essential. Soldiers will need to watch each other's backs and revive each other in a timely manner, while Lightphobes will need to coordinate with one another to ambush the Soldiers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 different loadouts to choose from<br></li><li>3 highly replayable multiplayer maps plus an extra Arena Challenge map (singleplayer only)<br></li><li>up to 16-player lobbies<br></li><li>offline singleplayer support through AI bots<br></li><li>built-in team voice chat and text chat<br></li><li>replay system for spectating past matches<br></li><li>community-run dedicated servers and peer-to-peer networking support means anyone can host a game, with official dedicated servers being available as well</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Lightphobe is a game that's all about the satisfying feeling of knifing players in FPS games, and also the flip side of catching knifers in the act!<br><br>Invincible in the dark, Lightphobes must be exposed by a special light source before they can be killed. This additional game mechanic gives Lightphobes more agency to move around, but closing the gap and eliminating soldiers will still require cunning stealth skills and quick thinking.<br><br>No matter what side you pick, teamwork will be essential. Soldiers will need to watch each other's backs and revive each other in a timely manner, while Lightphobes will need to coordinate with one another to ambush the Soldiers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 different loadouts to choose from<br></li><li>3 highly replayable multiplayer maps plus an extra Arena Challenge map (singleplayer only)<br></li><li>up to 16-player lobbies<br></li><li>offline singleplayer support through AI bots<br></li><li>built-in team voice chat and text chat<br></li><li>replay system for spectating past matches<br></li><li>community-run dedicated servers and peer-to-peer networking support means anyone can host a game, with official dedicated servers being available as well</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Beware of the darkness... Lightphobe is an asymmetrical team-based game that blends stealth action with fast-paced shooter gameplay. Pick a side and work together as a team to emerge victorious!",
